OL,3,ATwo charged over alleged plot to assist
OL,4,AIran in RAF Fairford incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FNouman Essghir, also 24 and from
OL,7,FWestminster, has been charged under
OL,8,FSection 4 of the same act with entering
OL,9,Fa prohibited place for a purpose
OL,10,Fprejudicial to the UK on 22 August -
OL,11,Fweeks before he was arrested near the
OL,12,Fairbase in Gloucestershire alongside
OL,13,Ffour other men.
OL,15,FThe pair will appear at Westminster
OL,16,FMagistrates' Court on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
