OL,3,AMen abused woman advertised by husband,
OL,4,Acourt told
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the trial began, prosecutor Sarah
OL,7,FJones KC told the jury: "This case is
OL,8,Fabout whether it is ever reasonable to
OL,9,Fhave sex with an unknown woman without
OL,10,Fchecking with her first."
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
