OL,3,ANorway and Finland leaders hold rare
OL,4,Acall with Putin
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leaders of Finland and Norway have
OL,7,Fheld a joint call with Vladimir Putin -
OL,8,Fa rare contact between the Russian
OL,9,Fpresident and European leaders.
OL,11,FThe aim was looking at "future
OL,12,Fnegotiations to help to end the war" in
OL,13,FUkraine, the offices of President
OL,14,FAlexander Stubb and Prime Minister
OL,15,FJonas Gahr StC8re said. Their
OL,16,Finitiative was not on behalf of "Europe
OL,17,Fas a whole".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
